## Attribution note

This skill distills frameworks from 55+ books by ~50 authors. The frameworks
remain the intellectual work of their original authors. This skill provides
interpretation, structuring, and stack-analysis logic — it does not reproduce
the books themselves.

Full attribution in `library/INDEX.md`.

If you find this skill useful and want to support the authors whose work
informed it, please buy their books directly.
